WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:04.205
Unit two. Peer Pressure and Decision-Making!

2
00:00:05.146 --> 00:00:08.635
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.685 --> 00:00:11.661
