4
00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:15.815
Today we learn about Peer Pressure and Decision-Making. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.615 --> 00:00:20.215
Peer pressure. Say it with me. Peer pressure!

6
00:00:23.742 --> 00:00:28.409
Decision-making. Say it with me. Decision-making!

7
00:00:31.873 --> 00:00:35.773
Assertiveness. Say it with me. Assertiveness!

8
00:00:39.331 --> 00:00:42.981
Consequence. Say it with me. Consequence!

9
00:00:46.511 --> 00:00:50.328
Influence. Say it with me. Influence!

10
00:00:53.807 --> 00:00:57.441
Confidence. Say it with me. Confidence!

11
00:01:00.963 --> 00:01:04.363
Values. Say it with me. Values!

12
00:01:07.842 --> 00:01:11.875
Independent thinking. Say it with me. Independent thinking!

13
00:01:15.316 --> 00:01:26.560
Peer pressure can strongly influence decision-making at my age. Practicing assertiveness and independent thinking helps me stay true to my values. Every choice has a consequence, so confidence matters.

14
00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:29.464
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:30.984 --> 00:01:36.293
