16
00:01:36.343 --> 00:01:37.708
Assertiveness!

17
00:01:38.782 --> 00:01:43.962
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:44.012 --> 00:01:45.162
Values!

19
00:01:46.067 --> 00:01:53.276
Did you know? Teens who practice saying 'no' in low-pressure situations find it easier to do so in harder moments.

20
00:01:53.326 --> 00:01:55.334
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:56.053 --> 00:02:04.537
Think and answer. Describe a time you had to make a decision despite peer pressure.

22
00:02:04.587 --> 00:02:05.737
Great answer!

23
00:02:06.792 --> 00:02:11.329
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
